---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---

<!-- Who Can Join Section -->
<section id="who-can-join" class="who-can-join-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Who Can Join?</h2>
        <p class="section-description">CICON Hack 2025 is open to everyone who wants to make repair better</p>
        
        <div class="requirements-grid">
            <div class="requirement-item">
                <div class="requirement-icon"><Icon name="lucide:users-round" /></div>
                <h3>For University Level and Up</h3>
                <p>Open to university students, fresh graduates, young professionals, and anyone beyond. No upper age limit.</p>
              </div>
            
            <div class="requirement-item">
                <div class="requirement-icon"><Icon name="lucide:handshake" /></div>
                <h3>Team or Solo</h3>
                <p>Join with up to 3 others (max 4 people total) or come solo, we'll help match you with a team if you're looking for one.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="requirement-item">
                <div class="requirement-icon"><Icon name="lucide:lightbulb" /></div>
                <h3>No Experience Required</h3>
                <p>Come as you are! Whether you code, design, make content, or just bring ideas; we need all kinds of thinkers to build better repair.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="requirement-item">
                <div class="requirement-icon"><Icon name="lucide:languages" /></div>
                <h3>Speak & Pitch in English</h3>
                <p>The event will be run in English, so you'll need to pitch and collaborate using English during the hackathon.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="requirements-note">
            <p>Not sure if you're a fit? <a href="/faq" class="requirements-link">Check our FAQ</a> or just reach out, we're here to help!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section> 